:name: nRF52840
:description: Runs a Zephyr ELF on Renode's nRF52840 model, with UART0 in the log.
:
: Set $elf to an absolute path before including this script. From apps/10-renode:
:
:   renode --console --disable-xwt -e "\$elf=@$PWD/build/zephyr/zephyr.elf; include @run_nrf52.resc"
:
: With --disable-xwt, showAnalyzer writes UART lines to Renode's log, tagged "uart0:".

mach create "nrf52840"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl

showAnalyzer uart0

sysbus LoadELF $elf

start
